OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers are possible this evening but
OL,7,Fthese will fade away overnight.
OL,8,FIsolated showers remain a possibility
OL,9,Fbut most places will stay dry with
OL,10,Fclear periods. A fresher night and
OL,11,Fturning rather chilly in some rural
OL,12,Fspots.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FThe small chance of a brief
OL,15,Fpassing shower, mainly during the
OL,16,Fmorning. Otherwise a dry day with a
OL,17,Fmixture of cloud and sunny spells.
OL,18,FFeeling warm but breezy at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
