OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWarm
OL,6,Fwith plenty of sunshine on Sunday,
OL,7,Fturning hazy later. More changeable
OL,8,Fearly next week with a chance of
OL,9,Fwelcome rain or showers, possible
OL,10,Fthundery. Turning warmer and
OL,11,Fincreasingly humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
